### Create customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Asha Nair","email":"asha@example.com","contact":"9876543210","address":"Kasaragod, Kerala"}

### List customers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers

### Find customer by email
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/by-email?email=asha@example.com

### Create warehouse (contact must be globally unique and exactly 10 digits)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Central Warehouse","location":"Bengaluru","capacity":500,"contact":"0801234567"}

### Create delivery agent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/delivery-agents
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Rahul K","contact":"9876501234","vehicleNo":"KA01AB1234","availabilityStatus":"AVAILABLE","rating":4.5}

### Find agents with rating >= 4
GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery-agents/by-min-rating?rating=4

### Create shipment (first create customer/warehouse/agent and use their returned IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{"source":"Kasaragod, Kerala","destination":"Bengaluru, Karnataka","weight":2.5,"deliveryDate":"2026-10-30","customerId":1,"warehouseId":1,"deliveryAgentId":1,"packageType":"BOX","fragile":false,"length":20,"breadth":15,"height":10,"paymentMethod":"UPI","initialLocation":"Kasaragod"}

### List shipments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipments

### Update shipment status (replace ID)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/shipments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_TRANSIT","location":"Mangaluru Transit Hub"}

### List shipment tracking history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipments/1/history

### Find packages by type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/packages/by-type?packageType=BOX

### Find payment records by customer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/by-customer/1

### List all tracking history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracking-history
